<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian 91-day T-bill rate rises to 11.56 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian 91-day T-bill rate rises to 11.56 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on Lithuanian 91-day Treasury bills rose to 11.56 percent at auction on Monday from 11.0 percent at the last sale of 91-day T-bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of litas unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD    (LAST WEEK)   MIN/MAX   ISSUE   BID</p>
<p> 91-day	11.56	 11.0	 10.0/15.33  55    53.45</p>
<p>Settlement for today's auction is on September 19 and the bills mature on December 19.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
</text>
